# Only server/ is copied into the image. Secrets and local state must never be baked into a layer:
# app.py reads server/.env if it exists, so a copied .env would silently override nothing-set values.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!server/.env.example
server/patients.json
server/outages.json
server/staff.json
server/.patients-*
server/.outages-*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.git
.hallmark
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
firmware
hardware
docs
supabase
*.pen
